118 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (At GIX Nexus Telecom and Power, our goal is to build long-term partnerships by providing professional solutions tailored to our clients' operational needs. As Managing Director, I bring practical experience in satellite communications \(SATCOM\), including the installation, operation, preventive maintenance, and corrective maintenance of satellite communication systems and related telecommunications infrastructure. Throughout my career, I have developed a strong understanding of telecommunications engineering, RF systems, VSAT technology, and technical support, enabling our company to provide reliable and effective solutions.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
119 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (Our technical capability is further strengthened by qualified personnel, including a Cisco Certified professional, whose networking expertise supports the design, installation, configuration, and maintenance of modern communication networks. This combination of satellite communications experience and industry-recognized networking skills enables us to deliver integrated telecommunications solutions to our clients.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
120 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (We are committed to operating with integrity, professionalism, safety, and quality in every project we undertake. Whether supporting telecommunications operators, government institutions, embassies, NGOs, or private organizations, we strive to exceed expectations through technical excellence, responsive service, and continuous improvement.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
